## portus.error — fallos HTTP como valores.
##
## Un handler devuelve `result of void to HttpError`: `ok` cuando ya escribió la
## respuesta, `err` cuando quiere que portus genere la página de error. No se
## usa `panic` para datos del usuario.
##
## El error es un `rune` con una categoría (`HttpErrorKind`) y un mensaje: así
## el despachador decide el código de estado sin inspeccionar texto.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## weave show with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
##     calling context.send_text with "hola"
##     return calling portus.ok_void
## ```
import std.ward

omen HttpErrorKind:
    ## La petición está mal formada o viola el contrato de la ruta.
    BadRequest
    ## Falta autenticación.
    Unauthorized
    ## Hay identidad pero no permiso.
    Forbidden
    ## La ruta no existe.
    NotFound
    ## La ruta existe, el método no.
    MethodNotAllowed
    ## Choque con el estado actual (p. ej. un duplicado).
    Conflict
    ## El cuerpo supera `Config.max_body_bytes`.
    PayloadTooLarge
    ## `Content-Type` no es el que la ruta acepta.
    UnsupportedMediaType
    ## Límite de tasa alcanzado.
    TooManyRequests
    ## Fallo del servidor; portus no expone el detalle al cliente.
    Internal

## Un fallo HTTP con su categoría y un mensaje para el cliente.
rune HttpError derive Par:
    ## Qué salió mal.
    kind as HttpErrorKind
    ## Texto que verá el cliente (genérico para `Internal`).
    message as string

## Error 400 con un mensaje concreto.
weave bad_request with message as string into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.BadRequest, message is message

## Error 401.
weave unauthorized into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.Unauthorized, message is "unauthorized"

## Error 403.
weave forbidden into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.Forbidden, message is "forbidden"

## Error 404.
weave not_found into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.NotFound, message is "not found"

## Error 405 con la cabecera `Allow` ya formateada.
weave method_not_allowed with allow as string into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.MethodNotAllowed, message is allow

## Error 409 con un mensaje concreto.
weave conflict with message as string into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.Conflict, message is message

## Error 413.
weave payload_too_large into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.PayloadTooLarge, message is "payload too large"

## Error 415.
weave unsupported_media_type into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.UnsupportedMediaType, message is "unsupported media type"

## Error 429.
weave too_many_requests into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.TooManyRequests, message is "too many requests"

## Error 500. El mensaje siempre es genérico: el detalle no sale al cliente.
weave internal into HttpError:
    return with kind is HttpErrorKind.Internal, message is "internal server error"

## Código de estado HTTP de un error.
weave status_of with failure as HttpError into int:
    return judge failure.kind:
        when BadRequest -> 400
        when Unauthorized -> 401
        when Forbidden -> 403
        when NotFound -> 404
        when MethodNotAllowed -> 405
        when Conflict -> 409
        when PayloadTooLarge -> 413
        when UnsupportedMediaType -> 415
        when TooManyRequests -> 429
        when Internal -> 500

## Texto para el cuerpo de la página de error.
weave message_of with failure as HttpError into string:
    return failure.message

test "el status corresponde a la categoría":
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling bad_request with "x")), 400
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling unauthorized)), 401
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling forbidden)), 403
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling not_found)), 404
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling method_not_allowed with "GET, POST")), 405
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling conflict with "x")), 409
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling payload_too_large)), 413
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling unsupported_media_type)), 415
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling too_many_requests)), 429
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with (calling internal)), 500

test "el mensaje del 400 es el que dio el handler":
    var failure as HttpError is calling bad_request with "falta el nombre"
    calling ward.assert_eq_string with (calling message_of with failure), "falta el nombre"

test "el 500 nunca filtra el detalle interno":
    var failure as HttpError is calling internal
    calling ward.assert_eq_string with (calling message_of with failure), "internal server error"

test "method_not_allowed guarda la lista de métodos":
    var failure as HttpError is calling method_not_allowed with "GET, HEAD"
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with failure), 405
    calling ward.assert_eq_string with (calling message_of with failure), "GET, HEAD"

test "conflict lleva su mensaje":
    var failure as HttpError is calling conflict with "ya existe"
    calling ward.assert_eq_int with (calling status_of with failure), 409
    calling ward.assert_eq_string with (calling message_of with failure), "ya existe"

test "unauthorized y forbidden no filtran detalle":
    calling ward.assert_eq_string with (calling message_of with (calling unauthorized)), "unauthorized"
    calling ward.assert_eq_string with (calling message_of with (calling forbidden)), "forbidden"
